Protrack (www.protrack365.com) is an online service platform based on tracking, controlling, managing GPS devices.
With Protrack APP, you will be able to,
1.View the status, location, wheel path and alert information of all GPS devices under the current account;
2.Record the vehicle license plate, GPS installation location, maintenance details and other information to facilitate the daily management and scheduling of the fleet;
3.Send command through the APP to control the GPS device remotely, so as to control the vehicle;
4.View daily/weekly/monthly reports on speeding, geo-fence, route deviation, single trip, accumulated mileage, fuel consumption, etc.;
5.Other function modules of business development;
Protrack supports more than 500 types of GPS devices from different brands.
If you have any questions during use, please contact your dealer for technical support.

